                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/24830: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Summerlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-01-10T12:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic">January 10,
                                1921—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 6:37 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>7. Local press publishes Foreign Office statement that Ecuador has recognized
                    Mexican Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
